# CLI authentication normally uses `pnpm exec wrangler login`.
# The Worker uses native D1, R2 and Queues bindings; no S3 keys are needed.
# Explicitly select a private Wrangler config for builds and deployment:
# ARCAEA_CONFIG=wrangler.production.jsonc
# Optional alternative for automation (D1/R2/Workers permissions required):
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=...
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=...
